From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: taynotfound <marztayron@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:10:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rain-0990: AW87390 speaker amp; modem-partition files by FAT name

rain's speaker amp is an Awinic AW87390 at 0x58 on QUP0 SE1 (DT), not
topaz's sia8159: chip id check (0x76), then profile 0 ("Music") of the
stock aw87xxx_acf.bin, off = SYSCTRL 0. Firmware files on the modem
partition are looked up by name in its FAT (FAT16/32, 8.3 names) before
topaz's offset table, which was measured on the Redmi Note 12's
NON-HLOS.bin. Host-tested on FAT16 and FAT32 images.
Note: rain's ADSP runs the APR/Elite stack (DT qcom,msm-audio-apr), not
AudioReach: TopazAudio's GPR graph will not come up as it is.
---
diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAudio.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAudio.cpp
index 6bfe1a2..cbea497 100644
